     mmaalloo — Marvell Libertas IEEE 802.11b/g wireless network driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee mmaalloo
           ddeevviiccee ppccii
           ddeevviiccee wwllaann
           ddeevviiccee ffiirrmmwwaarree

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           if_malo_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmaalloo driver provides support for Marvell Libertas 88W8335 based PCI
     and Cardbus network adapters.  mmaalloo supports ssttaattiioonn and mmoonniittoorr mode op‐
     eration.  Only one virtual interface may be configured at any time.  For
     more information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

     This driver requires firmware to be loaded before it will work.  The
     _p_o_r_t_s_/_n_e_t_/_m_a_l_o_-_f_i_r_m_w_a_r_e_-_k_m_o_d port needs to be installed before
     ifconfig(8) will work.

